#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Finalize one authenticated exact-distinctness cohort as a logical wave.

Draft agents never write the live stock.  This process authenticates every
member and every external peer first, acquires the complete shard lock-set,
then advances an append-only journal while installing all planned drafts.
Within the wave a member may be at its declared preimage or declared staged
hash; any other drift is external and fails closed.  Provenance and the final
against-stock audits run only after every planned mutation is visible.

The transaction is deliberately roll-forward.  A crash can leave a prefix of
members installed, but the durable private journal binds that prefix to the
same queue artifact, wave id and staged hashes.  Re-running the *same* command
can resume it; no preimage is silently restored and no partial run emits a
green receipt or publication authority.
"""

